<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76973" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλίν-τροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turned away, averted</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμματα, ὄψις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				777
			</span></i>(lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.</u>
				173
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>turning back</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἕρπειν,
				στρέφεσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				1222
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>HF</u>
				1069
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐκ πολέμοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.61
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κέλευθος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Parm.
					6.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>changing to the other side, contrary</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλάστιγξ τοῦ βίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					576.5
				</span></i>
			 (s. v.l.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῆς ἐλπίδος ἀποβαινούσης πρὸς τὰς
					ἐξ ἀρχῆς ἐπιβολάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					14.6.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ταῖς ἐξ ἀρχῆς ἐλπίσιν</span>
			<i>exactly contrary</i> to their original expectations, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.16.9
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.21.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ποιῆσαι τὴν μάχην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					15.85
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>Mith.</u>
				88
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ποιήσασθαι τὴν δίωξιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Onos.
					27
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίστροφον</span>
			)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; τὸ π. τοῦ δαιμονίου</span>
			<i>changeableness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				35.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>turning to flight</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					10.54
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλίντονος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1.3
			</span></i>.</div>
